[PrintTextModified Text:放风时间就快结束了。|#0204Adv09_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:结果还是没找到典狱长……<br>抱歉啊，希罗，让你白跑一趟……|#0204Adv09_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅沮丧地垂下肩膀，<br>显得有些泄气。|#0204Adv09_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:没关系，以后有时间再找吧。<br>今天就算是出来散散心了。|#0204Adv09_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:有希罗在我身边真好。|#0204Adv09_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅抬起头，笑着对我说道。|#0204Adv09_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是你的坚强支撑着我。|#0204Adv09_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:能走到现在，<br>一定是因为希罗一直在我身边。|#0204Adv09_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然中断了一段时间，<br>表演舞台剧这件事也要继续推进。<br>好，继续加油吧！|#0204Adv09_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:总是说些肉麻的话啊，你这人……|#0204Adv09_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，你还真的打算继续做舞台剧啊。|#0204Adv09_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:当然！<br>这可是我的动力之源！<br>希罗也能帮忙的话就更好了。|#0204Adv09_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:在我能力范围内的事，我会帮忙的……<br>让大家都有事可做，也对精神健康有益。|#0204Adv09_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我无奈地叹了口气，<br>但心里却有些释然。|#0204Adv09_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:至少，蕾雅身上没有魔女化的迹象。|#0204Adv09_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:或许是因为有我在，<br>某种程度上帮助她<br>维持了精神上的平衡。|#0204Adv09_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不过，仍然不能掉以轻心。<br>　任何人，随时都有可能因某个契机<br>　滋生出魔女的杀意……）|#0204Adv09_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:该回房间了。|#0204Adv09_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。|#0204Adv09_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管内心告诫自己不能放松警惕，<br>但我仍然因为与蕾雅并肩而行而感到安心。|#0204Adv09_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有蕾雅在身边真好。|#0204Adv09_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我自己没法主动说出这么害羞的话，<br>但我想，她和我一定是同样的心情。|#0204Adv09_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

